*> vybe-test: cobol/special_names_configuration/special_names_alphabet_user_runtime
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_special_names_configuration.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SPECIAL-NAMES.
    ALPHABET MY-ALPHA IS "A" THRU "Z".
    COLLATING SEQUENCE IS MY-ALPHA.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 A PIC X VALUE "B".
01 B PIC X VALUE "F".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF A < B DISPLAY "ORDERED" END-IF
    STOP RUN.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "ORDERED" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "ORDERED"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [ORDERED] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.

